---
// Two styles of distributed transaction side by side: XA across products vs one database with Raft groups.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="txxr">
  <div class="txxr-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 360" role="img" aria-label="Two panels. Left, XA across different products: an application server acts as coordinator and keeps its log on a local disk, and talks to PostgreSQL and a message broker over XA; it cannot see deadlocks across the two products and a crash of that server leaves locks in doubt. Right, a database-internal transaction: every participant runs the same database software, and each shard is a replicated Raft or Paxos group, so the coordinator state survives a node failure and failover is automatic.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Who keeps the commit decision safe?</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Ai giữ quyết định commit cho an toàn?</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="20" y="44" width="430" height="300" rx="6" class="txxr-panel is-bad" />
    <text x="36" y="70" class="sec is-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>XA across different products</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>XA giữa các sản phẩm khác nhau</tspan></text>
    <rect x="130" y="88" width="210" height="76" rx="6" class="txxr-box is-bad" />
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={160} y={120} size={30} />
    <text x="186" y="116" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>App server</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>App server</tspan></text>
    <text x="186" y="134" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>is the coordinator</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>làm coordinator</tspan></text>
    <text x="186" y="151" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>log on its own disk</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>log trên đĩa của nó</tspan></text>
    <path d="M200,166 L110,206" class="txxr-arrow" /><polygon points="104,209 109,201 113,210" class="txxr-head" />
    <path d="M270,166 L360,206" class="txxr-arrow" /><polygon points="366,209 357,210 361,201" class="txxr-head" />
    <rect x="36" y="212" width="170" height="62" rx="4" class="txxr-box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="postgres" x={64} y={243} size={28} />
    <text x="90" y="240" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>PostgreSQL</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>PostgreSQL</tspan></text>
    <text x="90" y="258" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>holds row locks</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>giữ khoá dòng</tspan></text>
    <rect x="264" y="212" width="170" height="62" rx="4" class="txxr-box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="mail" x={292} y={243} size={28} />
    <text x="318" y="240" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Message broker</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Message broker</tspan></text>
    <text x="318" y="258" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>e.g. ActiveMQ</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ví dụ ActiveMQ</tspan></text>
    <text x="235" y="304" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>No deadlock detection across the two products.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Không phát hiện deadlock giữa hai sản phẩm.</tspan></text>
    <text x="235" y="324" class="note is-bad" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>If the app server dies, locks stay in doubt.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>App server chết thì khoá bị treo.</tspan></text>

    <rect x="470" y="44" width="410" height="300" rx="6" class="txxr-panel is-ok" />
    <text x="486" y="70" class="sec"><tspan data-lang-en>One database, Raft or Paxos groups</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một database, các nhóm Raft hoặc Paxos</tspan></text>
    <rect x="490" y="88" width="170" height="130" rx="6" class="txxr-box is-ok" />
    <text x="575" y="108" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Shard A</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Shard A</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={522} y={150} size={26} />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={575} y={150} size={26} />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={628} y={150} size={26} />
    <text x="575" y="190" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>3 replicas agree</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>3 bản sao đồng thuận</tspan></text>
    <rect x="690" y="88" width="170" height="130" rx="6" class="txxr-box is-ok" />
    <text x="775" y="108" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Shard B</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Shard B</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={722} y={150} size={26} />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={775} y={150} size={26} />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={828} y={150} size={26} />
    <text x="775" y="190" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>3 replicas agree</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>3 bản sao đồng thuận</tspan></text>
    <path d="M662,153 L688,153" class="txxr-arrow" /><polygon points="662,153 670,149 670,157" class="txxr-head" /><polygon points="688,153 680,149 680,157" class="txxr-head" />
    <text x="675" y="244" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Same software everywhere, so it can detect deadlocks.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cùng một phần mềm ở mọi nơi nên phát hiện được deadlock.</tspan></text>
    <text x="675" y="266" class="note is-ok" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>A node dies: the group elects a new leader, no locks hang.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một node chết: nhóm bầu leader mới, không khoá nào bị treo.</tspan></text>
    <text x="675" y="298" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Spanner, CockroachDB, FoundationDB, TiDB, YugabyteDB</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Spanner, CockroachDB, FoundationDB, TiDB, YugabyteDB</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>In XA the commit decision lives on one ordinary server, outside the databases it coordinates. Inside a distributed database the same decision is stored by a replicated group, so losing one machine does not freeze the transaction.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Với XA, quyết định commit nằm trên một server bình thường, bên ngoài các database nó điều phối. Trong một database phân tán, chính quyết định đó được một nhóm sao chép lưu giữ, nên mất một máy không làm đóng băng transaction.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .txxr { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .txxr-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .txxr svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .txxr text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .txxr .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txxr .sec { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txxr .sec.is-bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .txxr .b { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txxr .m { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .txxr .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 12px; }
  .txxr .note { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .txxr .note.is-bad { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 600; }
  .txxr .note.is-ok { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 600; }
  .txxr .num { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txxr-panel { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .txxr-panel.is-bad { stroke: var(--red); }
  .txxr-panel.is-ok { stroke: var(--gold); }
  .txxr-box { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .txxr-box.is-bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .txxr-box.is-ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .txxr-dot { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .txxr-arrow { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .txxr-arrow.is-bad { stroke: var(--red); }
  .txxr-arrow.is-ok { stroke: var(--gold); }
  .txxr-dash { stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .txxr-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .txxr-head.is-bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .txxr-head.is-ok { fill: var(--gold); }
  .txxr-life { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .txxr figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.5; }
</style>
